---
import Buttons from "../../buttons.astro";
---

<section class="h-screen p-8 flex flex-col justify-evenly">
  <div class="flex w-full justify-between">
    <p>Paso 5 - 10</p>
    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <Buttons
        link2="hidden"
        button="hidden"
        link="border-none text-xl "
        text="<"
      />
      <Buttons
        link2="hidden"
        button="hidden"
        link="border-none text-xl "
        text=">"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-xl text-center">¿Cual es tu tono de rubio?</p>
  <div class="h-[516px] grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 justify-around">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
      <p>Rubio Cenizo / Platino (Frio)</p>
      <label
        class="h-full w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-evenly group hover:cursor-pointer"
        title="Rubio Cenizo / Platino"
      >
        <input
          type="radio"
          name="TonoDeRubio"
          id="rubioCenizo"
          value="Cenizo"
          class="hidden"
        />
        <div
          class="h-[130px] w-[130px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8F877C] from-50% to-[#E6E3DA] to-50% rotate-45 shadow-inner shadow-black/40 group-hover:scale-105 delay-200 transition-all ease-linear border border-[#D1C7B7]"
        >
        </div>
      </label>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-[300px]">
        Descripción: Rubio mate que tira hacia el gris, blanco o perla. No tiene
        reflejos amarillos intensos.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
      <p>Rubio Dorado / Miel (Calido)</p>
      <label
        class="h-full w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-evenly group hover:cursor-pointer"
        title="Rubio Dorado / Miel "
      >
        <input
          type="radio"
          name="TonoDeRubio"
          id="rubioMiel"
          value="Rubio Dorado / Miel"
          class="hidden"
        />
        <div
          class="h-[130px] w-[130px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#BE9D67] from-50% to-[#F3D788] to-50% rotate-45 shadow-inner shadow-black/40 group-hover:scale-105 delay-200 transition-all ease-linear border border-[#D1C7B7]"
        >
        </div>
      </label>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-[300px]">
        Descripción: Rubio vibrante y cálido. Brilla claramente en tonos
        amarillos, miel o trigo dorado.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
      <p>Rubio Oscuro / Neutro</p>
      <label
        class="h-full w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-evenly group hover:cursor-pointer"
        title="Rubio Oscuro / Neutro "
      >
        <input
          type="radio"
          name="TonoDeRubio"
          id="rubioNeutro"
          value="Rubio Oscuro / Neutro"
          class="hidden"
        />
        <div
          class="h-[130px] w-[130px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#786C5E] from-50% to-[#A3988B] to-50% rotate-45 shadow-inner shadow-black/40 group-hover:scale-105 delay-200 transition-all ease-linear border border-[#D1C7B7]"
        >
        </div>
      </label>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-[300px]">
        Descripción: Un rubio oscuro natural o beige. No es ni muy dorado ni muy
        gris, un tono intermedio equilibrado.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
